r 10:17</a>) intr. <em>err at cost of;</em> 𝔊 Ew Du Co <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲרֵעֹתֶם</span>); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מן</span> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 63:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.63.17\">Is 63:17</a>.","next":"BDB, תּוֹעָה²","prev":"BDB, תָּעַב"}